<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>ASOS Wealth Platform</title>
  <link
    href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@300;400;500&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap"
    rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #05070a;
      --s1: #0a0d13;
      --s2: #0f1420;
      --s3: #151c2a;
      --s4: #1c2538;
      --b1: #202c40;
      --b2: #2a3a52;
      --b3: #354a65;
      --tx: #d0d8ef;
      --t2: #7888a8;
      --t3: #3d4f6a;
      --t4: #273345;
      --gr: #18d490;
      --gd: #051b0f;
      --gl: rgba(24, 212, 144, .1);
      --bl: #4080ff;
      --bd: #0b1d44;
      --bgl: rgba(64, 128, 255, .1);
      --am: #f0a000;
      --ad: #2a1c00;
      --al: rgba(240, 160, 0, .1);
      --re: #f03050;
      --rd: #2a080e;
      --rl: rgba(240, 48, 80, .1);
      --pu: #9060f8;
      --pd: #180a38;
      --pl: rgba(144, 96, 248, .1);
      --te: #00b8e0;
      --td: #002430;
      --tl: rgba(0, 184, 224, .1);
      --pk: #f060a0;
      --pkd: #280518;
      --sidebar: 220px;
      --r: 6px;
      --r2: 11px;
      --r3: 16px;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0
    }

    html,
    body {
      height: 100%;
      overflow: hidden
    }

    body {
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--tx);
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      display: flex
    }

    .mono {
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace
    }

    /* ── SIDEBAR ── */
    .sidebar {
      width: var(--sidebar);
      height: 100vh;
      background: var(--s1);
      border-right: 1px solid var(--b1);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      overflow-y: auto
    }

    .sidebar-head {
      padding: 18px 16px 14px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--b1)
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 2px
    }

    .brand-mark {
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4080ff, #00b8e0);
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #fff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0
    }

    .brand-name {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -.03em;
      line-height: 1.1
    }

    .brand-version {
      font-size: 9px;
      color: var(--t3);
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
      letter-spacing: .06em
    }

    .user-chip {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 7px;
      background: var(--s2);
      border: 1px solid var(--b1);
      border-radius: var(--r);
      padding: 6px 8px;
      margin-top: 10px;
      cursor: pointer
    }

    .user-av {
      width: 22px;
      height: 22px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bl), var(--pu));
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #fff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0
    }

    .user-name {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      flex: 1;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
      white-space: nowrap
    }

    .user-plan {
      font-size: 9px;
      color: var(--gr);
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace
    }

    .nav-section {
      padding: 10px 10px 4px;
      font-size: 9px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--t3);
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .1em
    }

    .nav-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 9px;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      margin: 1px 6px;
      border-radius: var(--r);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--t2);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all .15s;
      position: relative;
      border: none;
      background: none;
      width: calc(100% - 12px);
      text-align: left
    }

    .nav-item:hover {
      background: var(--s2);
      color: var(--tx)
    }

    .nav-item.on {
      background: var(--bd);
      color: var(--bl);
      border: 1px solid rgba(64, 128, 255, .25)
    }

    .nav-item .ni-icon {
      font-size: 14px;
      width: 18px;
      text-align: center;
      flex-shrink: 0
    }

    .nav-item .ni-badge {
      margin-left: auto;
      font-size: 9px;
      padding: 1px 5px;
      border-radius: 3px;
      background: var(--re);
      color: #fff;
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace
    }

    .nav-item .ni-new {
      margin-left: auto;
      font-size: 9px;
      padding: 1px 6px;
      border-radius: 3px;
      background: var(--gd);
      color: var(--gr);
      border: 1px solid rgba(24, 212, 144, .3);
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace
    }

    .sidebar-footer {
      margin-top: auto;
      padding: 12px 10px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--b1)
    }

    .vix-chip {
      background: var(--s2);
      border: 1px solid var(--b1);
      border-radius: var(--r);
      padding: 6px 10px;
      font-size: 11px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 6px
    }

    .vix-label {
      color: var(--t3);
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10px
    }

    .vix-val {
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--gr)
    }

    /* ── MAIN AREA ── */
    .main {
      flex: 1;
      height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      overflow: hidden
    }

    .topbar {
      height: 48px;
      background: var(--s1);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--b1);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 0 20px;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-shrink: 0
    }

    .tb-title {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      flex: 1;
      letter-spacing: -.01em
    }

    .tb-pills {
      display: flex;
      gap: 6px
    }

    .tpill {
      padding: 3px 10px;
      border-radius: 99px;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
      cursor: pointer
    }

    .tpill-g {
      background: var(--gd);
      color: var(--gr);
      border: 1px solid rgba(24, 212, 144, .3)
    }

    .tpill-b {
      background: var(--bd);
      color: var(--bl);
      border: 1px solid rgba(64, 128, 255, .3)
    }

    .tpill-a {
      background: var(--ad);
      color: var(--am);
      border: 1px solid rgba(240, 160, 0, .3)
    }

    .blink {
      width: 5px;
      height: 5px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: currentColor;
      animation: blink 1.6s infinite
    }

    @keyframes blink {

      0%,
      100% {
        opacity: 1
      }

      50% {
        opacity: .2
      }
    }

    .content {
      flex: 1;
      overflow-y: auto;
      position: relative
    }

    .page {
      display: none;
      padding: 18px 20px;
      min-height: 100%
    }

    .page.on {
      display: block
    }

    /* ── COMMON ── */
    .grid2 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 10px
    }

    .grid3 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 10px
    }

    .grid4 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 8px
    }

    .grid6 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);
      gap: 1px;
      background: var(--b1);
      border: 1px solid var(--b1);
      border-radius: var(--r2);
      overflow: hidden;
      margin-bottom: 14px
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--s1);
      border: 1px solid var(--b1);
      border-radius: var(--r2);
      padding: 13px 15px
    }

    .sh {
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--t3);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .09em;
      margin: 14px 0 8px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace
    }

    .sh::after {
      content: '';
      flex: 1;
      height: 1px;
      background: var(--b1)
    }

    .note {
      background: var(--s2);
      border-radius: var(--r);
      padding: 8px 12px;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--t2);
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-top: 8px
    }

    .note-g {
      border-left: 2px solid var(--gr)
    }

    .note-b {
      border-left: 2px solid var(--bl)
    }

    .note-a {
      border-left: 2px solid var(--am)
    }

    .note-r {
      border-left: 2px solid var(--re)
    }

    .bx {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
      white-space: nowrap
    }

    .bx-g {
      background: var(--gd);
      color: var(--gr);
      border: 1px solid rgba(24, 212, 144, .25)
    }

    .bx-b {
      background: var(--bd);
      color: var(--bl);
      border: 1px solid rgba(64, 128, 255, .25)
    }

    .bx-a {
      background: var(--ad);
      color: var(--am);
      border: 1px solid rgba(240, 160, 0, .25)
    }

    .bx-r {
      background: var(--rd);
      color: var(--re);
      border: 1px solid rgba(240, 48, 80, .25)
    }

    .bx-p {
      background: var(--pd);
      color: var(--pu);
      border: 1px solid rgba(144, 96, 248, .25)
    }

    .bx-t {
      background: var(--td);
      color: var(--te);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 184, 224, .25)
    }

    .bx-s {
      background: var(--s3);
      color: var(--t2);
      border: 1px solid var(--b2)
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 12px
    }

    th {
      text-align: left;
      padding: 6px 8px;
      color: var(--t3);
      font-weight: 700;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--b1);
      font-size: 10px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .05em;
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
      white-space: nowrap
    }

    td {
      padding: 6px 8px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .03);
      vertical-align: middle
    }

    tr:hover td {
      background: var(--s2)
    }

    .metric-box {
      background: var(--s1);
      padding: 12px;
      position: relative
    }

    .mb-l {
      font-size: 9px;
      color: var(--t3);
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .07em;
      margin-bottom: 4px
    }

    .mb-v {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -.03em
    }

    .mb-d {
      font-size: 10px;
      margin-top: 2px;
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace
    }

    /* ── AI CHAT ── */
    .chat-wrap {
      background: var(--s1);
      border: 1px solid var(--b1);
      border-radius: var(--r2);
      overflow: hidden
    }

    .chat-head {
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--b1);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700
    }

    .msgs {
      padding: 12px 14px;
      height: 380px;
      overflow-y: auto;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px
    }

    .msg {
      max-width: 88%;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 9px 12px;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.55
    }

    .msg-u {
      background: var(--bd);
      color: var(--bl);
      align-self: flex-end;
      border: 1px solid rgba(64, 128, 255, .2)
    }

    .msg-a {
      background: var(--s2);
      align-self: flex-start;
      border: 1px solid var(--b1)
    }

    .msg-a strong {
      color: var(--gr)
    }

    .msg-a em {
      color: var(--am)
    }

    .chat-in {
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--b1);
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px
    }

    .cin {
      flex: 1;
      background: var(--s2);
      border: 1px solid var(--b2);
      border-radius: var(--r);
      padding: 8px 12px;
      color: var(--tx);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      outline: none
    }

    .cin:focus {
      border-color: var(--bl)
    }

    .csend {
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border-radius: var(--r);
      border: none;
      background: var(--bl);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: opacity .2s;
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif
    }

    .csend:disabled {
      opacity: .4;
      cursor: not-allowed
    }

    .typing span {
      width: 5px;
      height: 5px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--t3);
      display: inline-block;
      animation: ty .8s infinite
    }

    .typing span:nth-child(2) {
      animation-delay: .15s
    }

    .typing span:nth-child(3) {
      animation-delay: .3s
    }

    @keyframes ty {

      0%,
      60%,
      100% {
        transform: translateY(0)
      }

      30% {
        transform: translateY(-5px)
      }
    }

    /* ── EVENT CARDS ── */
    .ev-card {
      background: var(--s1);
      border: 1px solid var(--b1);
      border-radius: var(--r2);
      padding: 12px 14px;
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      transition: border-color .2s;
      cursor: pointer
    }

    .ev-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--b3)
    }

    .ev-date-box {
      width: 44px;
      text-align: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      background: var(--s2);
      border-radius: var(--r);
      padding: 6px 4px
    }

    .ev-day {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -.03em;
      line-height: 1
    }

    .ev-month {
      font-size: 9px;
      color: var(--t3);
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-top: 2px
    }

    .ev-body .ev-title {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 2px
    }

    .ev-body .ev-sub {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--t2);
      line-height: 1.4;
      margin-bottom: 5px
    }

    .ev-body .ev-impact {
      font-size: 11px;
      padding: 3px 8px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      display: inline-block;
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
      font-weight: 600
    }

    .ev-high {
      background: var(--rd);
      color: var(--re)
    }

    .ev-med {
      background: var(--ad);
      color: var(--am)
    }

    .ev-low {
      background: var(--gd);
      color: var(--gr)
    }

    .ev-countdown {
      margin-left: auto;
      text-align: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      white-space: nowrap
    }

    .ev-days {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--bl);
      letter-spacing: -.02em
    }

    .ev-dl {
      font-size: 9px;
      color: var(--t3);
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace
    }

    /* ── MOVERS ── */
    .mover-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 8px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .03);
      cursor: pointer
    }

    .mover-row:last-child {
      border: none
    }

    .mover-row:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .02);
      border-radius: var(--r)
    }

    .mover-name {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      width: 110px;
      flex-shrink: 0
    }

    .mover-bar {
      flex: 1;
      height: 5px;
      background: var(--s3);
      border-radius: 99px;
      overflow: hidden
    }

    .mover-fill {
      height: 100%;
      border-radius: 99px
    }

    .mover-pct {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      width: 60px;
      text-align: right;
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
      flex-shrink: 0
    }

    .mover-vol {
      font-size: 10px;
      color: var(--t3);
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
      width: 60px;
      text-align: right;
      flex-shrink: 0
    }

    /* ── NEWS ── */
    .news-item {
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .04);
      padding: 10px 0;
      cursor: pointer
    }

    .news-item:last-child {
      border: none
    }

    .news-item:hover .news-title {
      color: var(--bl)
    }

    .news-source {
      font-size: 10px;
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
      color: var(--t3);
      margin-bottom: 3px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px
    }

    .news-title {
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 3px;
      transition: color .15s;
      line-height: 1.4
    }

    .news-preview {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--t2);
      line-height: 1.4
    }

    .ns-dot {
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      flex-shrink: 0
    }

    /* ── WATCHLIST SCORE BAR ── */
    .sc-bar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px
    }

    .sc-track {
      flex: 1;
      height: 5px;
      background: var(--s3);
      border-radius: 99px;
      overflow: hidden
    }

    .sc-fill {
      height: 100%;
      border-radius: 99px
    }

    /* ── RANGE INPUT ── */
    input[type=range] {
      accent-color: var(--bl)
    }

    /* ── SCROLLBAR ── */
    ::-webkit-scrollbar {
      width: 3px;
      height: 3px
    }

    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
      background: var(--s1)
    }

    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
      background: var(--b2);
      border-radius: 2px
    }

    /* ── GAUGE ── */
    .gauge-mini {
      position: relative;
      height: 70px
    }

    /* ── IC LEGS ── */
    .leg-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 10px
    }

    .leg {
      background: var(--s2);
      border: 1px solid var(--b1);
      border-radius: var(--r2);
      padding: 10px 12px
    }

    .leg-head {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between
    }

    .lg {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 5px
    }

    .lf {
      background: var(--s3);
      border-radius: 5px;
      padding: 6px 8px
    }

    .lfl {
      font-size: 9px;
      color: var(--t3);
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 2px
    }

    .lfv {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -.01em
    }

    /* ── EXEC CHECKLIST ── */
    .exr {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 9px;
      padding: 7px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .03);
      cursor: pointer
    }

    .exr:last-child {
      border: none
    }

    .exck {
      width: 17px;
      height: 17px;
      border: 1px solid var(--b2);
      border-radius: 4px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      transition: all .15s;
      background: var(--s2);
      font-size: 10px;
      margin-top: 1px
    }

    .exck.done {
      background: var(--gr);
      border-color: var(--gr);
      color: #000
    }

    /* ── SETTINGS ── */
    .setting-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 10px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .04)
    }

    .setting-row:last-child {
      border: none
    }

    .sr-label {
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 500
    }

    .sr-sub {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--t3);
      margin-top: 1px
    }

    .sr-input {
      background: var(--s2);
      border: 1px solid var(--b2);
      border-radius: var(--r);
      padding: 6px 10px;
      color: var(--tx);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
      width: 220px;
      outline: none
    }

    .sr-input:focus {
      border-color: var(--bl)
    }

    .toggle {
      width: 34px;
      height: 18px;
      background: var(--s3);
      border-radius: 99px;
      cursor: pointer;
      position: relative;
      transition: background .2s;
      flex-shrink: 0
    }

    .toggle.on {
      background: var(--gr)
    }

    .toggle::after {
      content: '';
      width: 14px;
      height: 14px;
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 50%;
      position: absolute;
      top: 2px;
      left: 2px;
      transition: left .2s
    }

    .toggle.on::after {
      left: 18px
    }

    .save-btn {
      padding: 8px 20px;
      border-radius: var(--r2);
      border: none;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bl), var(--te));
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      transition: opacity .2s
    }

    .save-btn:hover {
      opacity: .88
    }

    /* ── DEPLOY SECTION ── */
    .deploy-step {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 10px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .04)
    }

    .deploy-step:last-child {
      border: none
    }

    .ds-num {
      width: 26px;
      height: 26px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-top: 1px
    }

    .ds-body .dt {
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 2px
    }

    .ds-body .ds {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--t2);
      line-height: 1.45;
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace
    }

    .code-inline {
      background: var(--s2);
      border: 1px solid var(--b1);
      border-radius: var(--r);
      padding: 10px 12px;
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--gr);
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin: 6px 0;
      overflow-x: auto
    }

    .arch-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 14px
    }

    .arch-card {
      background: var(--s2);
      border: 1px solid var(--b1);
      border-radius: var(--r2);
      padding: 12px;
      text-align: center
    }

    .arch-icon {
      font-size: 22px;
      margin-bottom: 6px
    }

    .arch-name {
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 3px
    }

    .arch-tech {
      font-size: 10px;
      color: var(--t3);
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
      line-height: 1.5
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <!-- ══ SIDEBAR ══ -->
  <div class="sidebar">
    <div class="sidebar-head">
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="brand-mark">A</div>
        <div>
          <div class="brand-name">ASOS Wealth</div>
          <div class="brand-version mono">PLATFORM v1.0</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="user-chip">
        <div class="user-av">AR</div>
        <div>
          <div class="user-name">Arnab</div>
          <div class="user-plan">Sovereign Plan</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="nav-section">Core</div>
    <button class="nav-item on" onclick="go('dashboard',this)"><span class="ni-icon">🏠</span>Dashboard</button>
    <button class="nav-item" onclick="go('market',this)"><span class="ni-icon">📡</span>Market Intel<span
        class="ni-new">NEW</span></button>

    <div class="nav-section">Portfolio</div>
    <button class="nav-item" onclick="go('holdings',this)"><span class="ni-icon">📋</span>My Holdings</button>
    <button class="nav-item" onclick="go('core22gap',this)"><span class="ni-icon">⭐</span>Core 22 Gap</button>
    <button class="nav-item" onclick="go('transition',this)"><span class="ni-icon">🔄</span>Transition Plan</button>
    <button class="nav-item" onclick="go('watchlist',this)"><span class="ni-icon">🔭</span>Watchlist Scout</button>
    <button class="nav-item" onclick="go('timing',this)"><span class="ni-icon">🎯</span>Buy/Sell Radar<span
        class="ni-new">LIVE</span></button>
    <button class="nav-item" onclick="go('sipopt',this)"><span class="ni-icon">💰</span>SIP Optimizer</button>
    <button class="nav-item" onclick="go('xirr',this)"><span class="ni-icon">📈</span>XIRR & Returns</button>
    <button class="nav-item" onclick="go('taxharvest',this)"><span class="ni-icon">🏛️</span>Tax Harvesting</button>

    <div class="nav-section">Trading</div>
    <button class="nav-item" onclick="go('optionschain',this)"><span class="ni-icon">📈</span>Options Chain<span
        class="ni-new">NEW</span></button>
    <button class="nav-item" onclick="go('tradebuilder',this)"><span class="ni-icon">⚡</span>Trade Builder</button>
    <button class="nav-item" onclick="go('monitor',this)"><span class="ni-icon">📊</span>Trading Monitor</button>
    <button class="nav-item" onclick="go('strategies',this)"><span class="ni-icon">🎯</span>Strategy Selector</button>

    <div class="nav-section">Intelligence</div>
    <button class="nav-item" onclick="go('aiscout',this)"><span class="ni-icon">🤖</span>AI Scout</button>
    <button class="nav-item" onclick="go('checklist',this)"><span class="ni-icon">✅</span>Execution<span
        class="ni-badge" id="pendingBadge">10</span></button>

    <div class="nav-section">System</div>
    <button class="nav-item" onclick="go('deploy',this)"><span class="ni-icon">🚀</span>Deploy Guide</button>
    <button class="nav-item" onclick="go('settings',this)"><span class="ni-icon">⚙️</span>Settings</button>

    <div class="sidebar-footer">
      <div class="vix-chip">
        <span class="vix-label">VIX</span>
        <span class="vix-val">13.4 ✓</span>
      </div>
      <div class="vix-chip">
        <span class="vix-label">IVP</span>
        <span class="vix-val">44.8%</span>
      </div>
      <div id="sidebarClock"
        style="font-size:10px;color:var(--t3);text-align:center;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;margin-top:6px">
        — : — IST</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ══ MAIN ══ -->
  <div class="main">
    <div class="topbar">
      <div class="tb-title" id="pageTitle">Dashboard</div>
      <div class="tb-pills">
        <div class="tpill tpill-g" id="marketStatusPill"><span class="blink"></span>Market open</div>
        <div class="tpill tpill-b" id="niftyPill">NIFTY — —</div>
        <div class="tpill tpill-a" id="topRightPill" style="display:none"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content">

      <!-- ════ DASHBOARD ════ -->
      <div id="dashboard" class="page on">
        <div class="grid6" style="margin-bottom:14px">
          <div class="metric-box" id="dm-corpus">
            <div class="mb-l">Corpus</div>
            <div class="mb-v" style="color:var(--bl)">Loading…</div>
            <div class="mb-d" style="color:var(--am)">Connect Zerodha</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-box" id="dm-pending">
            <div class="mb-l">Pending credit</div>
            <div class="mb-v" style="color:var(--am)" id="dmPendingVal">—</div>
            <div class="mb-d" style="color:var(--t3)" id="dmPendingLbl">Cash ledger</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-box" id="dm-progress">
            <div class="mb-l">Portfolio health</div>
            <div class="mb-v" style="color:var(--pu)" id="dmHealthVal">—</div>
            <div class="mb-d" style="color:var(--t3)" id="dmHealthLbl">computing…</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-box" id="dm-sip">
            <div class="mb-l">Monthly SIP</div>
            <div class="mb-v" style="color:var(--gr)">₹1,00,000</div>
            <div class="mb-d" style="color:var(--t3)" id="dm-sip-sub">Next: 5th</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-box" id="dm-2047">
            <div class="mb-l">2047 projection</div>
            <div class="mb-v" style="color:var(--gr)">Calculating…</div>
            <div class="mb-d" style="color:var(--t3)">At 20% CAGR</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-box" id="dm-ltcl">
            <div class="mb-l">Options income MTD</div>
            <div class="mb-v" style="color:var(--gr)" id="dmOptMtd">—</div>
            <div class="mb-d" style="color:var(--t3)">vs ₹25K target</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- REGIME BANNER (live thinking engine) -->
        <div id="regimeBanner" style="background:var(--s2);border:1px solid var(--b1);border-radius:var(--r);padding:14px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px">
          <div style="flex-shrink:0">
            <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--t3);font-family:var(--mono);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;margin-bottom:4px">Market regime</div>
            <div id="rbBadge" style="font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--bl)">Reading…</div>
          </div>
          <div style="flex:1;border-left:1px solid var(--b1);padding-left:16px">
            <div id="rbWhy" style="font-size:12px;color:var(--t3);margin-bottom:4px">Analysing live market data…</div>
            <div id="rbIntent" style="font-size:12px;color:var(--am);font-weight:500"></div>
          </div>
          <div style="flex-shrink:0;text-align:right">
            <div id="rbGate" style="font-size:11px;font-family:var(--mono);padding:5px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--s3);color:var(--t3)">Entry gate: —</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid2">
          <div>
            <div class="sh" style="margin-top:0">Earnings tracker — this month</div>
            <div id="incomeTracker" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px">
              <div style="background:var(--s2);border-radius:var(--r);padding:14px;text-align:center">
                <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--t3);font-family:var(--mono);margin-bottom:4px">OPTIONS INCOME
                </div>
                <div style="font-size:26px;font-weight:700;color:var(--gr)" id="incOpt">—</div>
                <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--t3)" id="incOptT">of target</div>
              </div>
              <div style="background:var(--s2);border-radius:var(--r);padding:14px;text-align:center">
                <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--t3);font-family:var(--mono);margin-bottom:4px">EQUITY REALISED
                </div>
                <div style="font-size:26px;font-weight:700;color:var(--bl)" id="incEq">—</div>
                <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--t3)" id="incEqT">of target</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="sh">Today's actions — live from engine</div>
            <div id="todayActions" style="margin-bottom:14px">
              <div style="color:var(--t3);font-size:12px;padding:10px">Loading actions…</div>
            </div>
            <div class="sh" style="margin-top:0">2047 corpus trajectory</div>
            <div class="card">
              <div style="position:relative;height:200px"><canvas id="dashProj" role="img"
                  aria-label="2047 projection chart"></canvas></div>
            </div>
            <div class="sh">Today's decisions — thinking engine</div>
            <div class="card" id="dashDecisions" style="min-height:60px">
              <div style="color:var(--t3);font-size:12px;padding:10px">Computing decisions…</div>
            </div>
            <div class="sh">Replacement watch — quality below floor</div>
            <div class="card" id="dashReplWatch" style="min-height:40px">
              <div style="color:var(--t3);font-size:12px;padding:10px">Checking Core 22 quality…</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ════ MARKET INTELLIGENCE ════ -->
      <div id="market" class="page">
        <div class="grid6" style="margin-bottom:14px">
          <div class="metric-box" id="mm-nifty">
            <div class="mb-l">Nifty 50</div>
            <div class="mb-v" style="color:var(--gr)">Loading…</div>
            <div class="mb-d" style="color:var(--t3)">Fetching live…</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-box" id="mm-bnifty">
            <div class="mb-l">Bank Nifty</div>
            <div class="mb-v" style="color:var(--gr)">Loading…</div>
            <div class="mb-d" style="color:var(--t3)">Fetching live…</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-box" id="mm-vix">
            <div class="mb-l">India VIX</div>
            <div class="mb-v" style="color:var(--gr)">Loading…</div>
            <div class="mb-d" style="color:var(--t3)">Fetching live…</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-box" id="mm-ivp">
            <div class="mb-l">IVP</div>
            <div class="mb-v" style="color:var(--am)">Loading…</div>
            <div class="mb-d" style="color:var(--t3)">Fetching live…</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-box" id="mm-adx">
            <div class="mb-l">ADX (14)</div>
            <div class="mb-v" style="color:var(--gr)">Loading…</div>
            <div class="mb-d" style="color:var(--t3)">Fetching live…</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-box" id="mm-dma">
            <div class="mb-l">50 DMA</div>
            <div class="mb-v" style="color:var(--am)">Loading…</div>
            <div class="mb-d" style="color:var(--t3)">Fetching live…</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:12px">

          <!-- EVENTS CALENDAR -->
          <div>
            <div class="sh" style="margin-top:0">Upcoming market events <span
                style="font-size:9px;color:var(--t3);font-family:var(--mono)" id="evUpdated"></span></div>
            <div id="eventsWrap">
              <div style="color:var(--t3);font-size:12px;padding:10px">Loading live events…</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="sh" style="margin-top:0">Top gainers today</div>
            <div class="card" style="padding:10px 14px;margin-bottom:12px">
              <div id="gainers"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="sh">Top losers today</div>
            <div class="card" style="padding:10px 14px;margin-bottom:12px">
              <div id="losers"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="sh">Volume leaders (surge)</div>
            <div class="card" style="padding:10px 14px">
              <div id="volumeLeaders"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- NEWS & ANALYSIS -->
          <div>
            <div class="sh" style="margin-top:0">Market news — AI analysed</div>
            <div class="card" style="padding:10px 14px;margin-bottom:12px">
              <div id="newsFeed"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="sh">Block deals & bulk deals today</div>
            <div class="card" style="padding:8px 12px;margin-bottom:12px">
              <table>
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th>Stock</th>
                    <th>Type</th>
                    <th>Qty</th>
                    <th>Price</th>
                    <th>Buyer/Seller</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr>
                    <td><strong>CGPOWER</strong></td>
                    <td><span class="bx bx-g">BUY</span></td>
                    <td class="mono">2.1L</td>
                    <td class="mono">₹938</td>
                    <td style="font-size:10px;color:var(--t3)">LIC India</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td><strong>INDUSINDBK</strong></td>
                    <td><span class="bx bx-g">BUY</span></td>
                    <td class="mono">8.4L</td>
                    <td class="mono">₹931</td>
                    <td style="font-size:10px;color:var(--t3)">Mirae AMC</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td><strong>PIRAMALFIN</strong></td>
                    <td><span class="bx bx-r">SELL</span></td>
                    <td class="mono">1.2L</td>
                    <td class="mono">₹1,988</td>
                    <td style="font-size:10px;color:var(--t3)">FII Sell</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td><strong>GRANULES</strong></td>
                    <td><span class="bx bx-g">BUY</span></td>
                    <td class="mono">3.5L</td>
                    <td class="mono">₹783</td>
                    <td style="font-size:10px;color:var(--t3)">HDFC AMC</td>
                  </tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
            <div class="sh">IPO pipeline</div>
            <div class="card" style="padding:8px 12px">
              <table>
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th>Company</th>
                    <th>Sector</th>
                    <th>Opens</th>
                    <th>Est. size</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr>
                    <td><strong>HYUNDAI INDIA</strong></td>
                    <td><span class="bx bx-a">Auto</span></td>
                    <td class="mono">Jun 15</td>
                    <td class="mono">₹25,000Cr</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td><strong>NSE IPO</strong></td>
                    <td><span class="bx bx-b">Exchange</span></td>
                    <td class="mono">Q3 2026</td>
                    <td class="mono">₹10,000Cr</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td><strong>ATHER ENERGY</strong></td>
                    <td><span class="bx bx-g">EV</span></td>
                    <td class="mono">Jul 2026</td>
                    <td class="mono">₹3,100Cr</td>
                  </tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- AI NEWS ANALYSIS CHAT -->
        <div class="sh" style="margin-top:16px">AI market analyst — ask about any news, event or stock</div>
        <div class="chat-wrap">
          <div class="chat-head">
            <div class="ai-dot blink" style="width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gr)"></div>ASOS
            Market Analyst · Powered by Claude
          </div>
          <div class="msgs" id="mktMsgs">
            <div class="msg msg-a">📰 I'm your market analyst. I can:<br><br>
              • <strong>Analyse market events</strong> — "What does tomorrow's RBI decision mean for my Core 22?"<br>
              • <strong>Explain movers</strong> — "Why is HINDCOPPER up 3% today?"<br>
              • <strong>News impact</strong> — "How does the US CPI data affect my options strategy?"<br>
              • <strong>Sector rotation</strong> — "Which sectors benefit from a Fed rate cut?"<br><br>
              What's on your mind today?</div>
          </div>
          <div class="chat-in">
            <input class="cin" id="mktInput" placeholder="Ask about any market event, news or stock movement..."
              onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')sendMkt()">
            <button class="csend" onclick="sendMkt()">Analyse →</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ════ TRANSITION ENGINE ════ -->
      <div id="transition" class="page">
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:14px">
          <div>
            <div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700">Portfolio Transition — 95 → Core 22</div>
            <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--t2)">47 exits done today · 4 remaining · Transition 64% complete
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px"><span class="bx bx-g">47 done</span><span class="bx bx-a">4 to
              go</span><span class="bx bx-b">4 to add</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:14px">
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:8px"><span
              style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600">Overall progress</span><span
              style="font-size:12px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;color:var(--gr)">64%</span></div>
          <div style="height:10px;background:var(--s3);border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:6px">
            <div
              style="width:64%;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--re),var(--am),var(--gr));border-radius:99px">
            </div>
          </div>
          <div
            style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:10px;color:var(--t3);font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace">
            <span>Start: 95 stocks</span><span>▼ Today: ~48</span><span>▼ Target: 22</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid2">
          <div>
            <div class="sh" style="margin-top:0">Still to sell — 4 remaining</div>
            <div class="card">
              <table>
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th>Stock</th>
                    <th>P&L</th>
                    <th>Trigger</th>
                    <th>Proceeds</th>
                    <th>Tax</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr>
                    <td><strong>ITC</strong></td>
                    <td class="mono" style="color:var(--re)">−30.1%</td>
                    <td style="font-size:11px">Alert set @₹325</td>
                    <td class="mono">~₹58K</td>
                    <td style="font-size:10px;color:var(--t3)">LTCL 146 LT</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td><strong>ABREL</strong></td>
                    <td class="mono" style="color:var(--re)">−37.7%</td>
                    <td style="font-size:11px">ST now · LT July</td>
                    <td class="mono">~₹66K</td>
                    <td style="font-size:10px;color:var(--t3)">Split LT/ST</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td><strong>NBCC</strong></td>
                    <td class="mono" style="color:var(--re)">−1.9%</td>
                    <td style="font-size:11px">Trim 1501→300</td>
                    <td class="mono">~₹90K</td>
                    <td style="font-size:10px;color:var(--t3)">LTCL harvest</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td><strong>KPITTECH</strong></td>
                    <td class="mono" style="color:var(--re)">−41.8%</td>
                    <td style="font-size:11px">IT rally +3%</td>
                    <td class="mono">~₹15K</td>
                    <td style="font-size:10px;color:var(--t3)">STCL+LTCL</td>
                  </tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
              <div class="note note-a" style="margin-top:8px">Set ITC price alert on Kite right now: ₹325 alert.
                KPITTECH — set sector alert when Nifty IT index rises 3%+ in a session.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="sh">New positions to add (Wednesday 4 Jun)</div>
            <div class="card">
              <table>
