      <!-- ════ AI SCOUT ════ -->
      <div id="aiscout" class="page">
        <p style="font-size:12px;color:var(--t2);margin-bottom:12px">Full-context AI scout. Knows your entire ASOS
          system — corpus, Core 22, SIP, transition status, options positions. Ask anything.</p>
        <div class="grid2">
          <div>
            <div class="chat-wrap">
              <div class="chat-head">
                <div class="blink" style="width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gr)"></div>ASOS AI
                Scout — powered by GLM 5.2
              </div>
              <div class="msgs" id="scoutMsgs">
                <div class="msg msg-a">🤖 GLM 5.2 AI Scout — I have full context of your ASOS system:<br><br>

                  <strong>Core 22 target</strong> — 18 existing + 4 new (MON100, JUNIORBEES, GOLDBEES, SHILCHAR).<br>
